                        <div class="field field--name-field-body-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden clearfix"><h2 class="text-align-center"><a href="/agencies/ebsa/researchers/statistics/retirement-bulletins/direct-filing-entity">Direct Filing Entity</a></h2><p class="text-align-center">Statistical summary of Form 5500 data on Direct Filing Entities (DFEs) including counts of DFEs, counts of private pension plans invested in DFEs, and asset counts. Table 11 distributes the assets reported by pension plans in DFEs into the other financial asset categories and replicates Table C4 of the <em>Private Pension Plan Bulletins Abstract of Form 5500 Annual Reports</em>.</p></div>
            
