      </h3>
              <div class="usa-card__content">
          

                        <div class="field field--name-field-body-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden clearfix"><h2 class="text-align-center"><a href="/agencies/ebsa/researchers/statistics/retirement-bulletins/pooled-employer-plan-bulletin">Pooled Employer Plan</a></h2><p class="text-align-center">Statistical tables of Form PR and Form 5500 data related to Pooled Plan Providers (PPPs) and Pooled Employer Plans (PEPs). Form PR data is used to identify the number of unique PPPs, their reasons for filing, how many PEPs they sponsor, and whether the PPP can be matched to a PEP Form 5500 filing. Additionally, data from PEP Form 5500 filings provides statistics on the total number of plans, participants, assets, and service providers.</p></div>
            
